Module 5 — Intelligent Dispatch Engine
Complete End-to-End Technical Documentation
The Intelligent Dispatch Engine is the core decision-making module of UyirKappan. Its responsibility is to determine which available ambulance should be assigned to an emergency request.
The key idea is that the system should not simply select the ambulance with the smallest geographic distance. Instead, it evaluates available ambulances using travel-related factors such as distance, traffic conditions, route travel time, and availability, and selects the candidate with the best expected response.
For the initial implementation, this engine will operate completely inside the controlled simulation environment. Virtual ambulances, a virtual road network, simulated traffic conditions, and emergency requests will allow the team to test and measure the dispatch algorithm before considering real-world integration.
________________________________________
1. Purpose of the Module
The primary objective is:
Given an emergency request and a set of available ambulances, identify the ambulance expected to reach the emergency location most efficiently under the current simulated conditions.
The engine must answer:
Emergency occurs at Location P.

Available:
A1
A2
A3
A4

Which ambulance should respond?
Instead of:
Nearest ambulance → selected
UyirKappan evaluates:
Location
+
Road distance
+
Traffic
+
Route travel time
+
Ambulance availability
+
Other configured constraints
        ↓
Best candidate
________________________________________
2. Position in the Overall Architecture
The Intelligent Dispatch Engine sits between the Backend and the Driver/Ambulance Applications.
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │    Bystander     │
                    │   Application    │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             │
                      Emergency Request
                             │
                             ▼
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │     Backend      │
                    │      API         │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             │
                             ▼
              ┌────────────────────────────┐
              │  INTELLIGENT DISPATCH      │
              │          ENGINE            │
              │                            │
              │ Candidate Discovery        │
              │ Route Calculation          │
              │ Traffic Evaluation         │
              │ Scoring                    │
              │ Candidate Selection        │
              └─────────────┬──────────────┘
                            │
                     Selected Ambulance
                            │
                            ▼
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Driver /         │
                    │ Ambulance App    │
                    └──────────────────┘
The engine itself does not directly control the driver's application.
It produces a dispatch decision, which the backend delivers to the selected ambulance.
