3. Complete Dispatch Flow
The end-to-end flow is:
Emergency Request
        ↓
Backend validates request
        ↓
Dispatch Engine triggered
        ↓
Find available ambulances
        ↓
Filter unsuitable candidates
        ↓
Calculate route for candidates
        ↓
Evaluate traffic conditions
        ↓
Calculate expected travel time
        ↓
Calculate candidate score
        ↓
Rank candidates
        ↓
Select best candidate
        ↓
Create assignment
        ↓
Send assignment to driver
        ↓
Wait for acceptance
        ↓
Accepted?
    /       \
  YES        NO/TIMEOUT
   │             │
   ▼             ▼
 Dispatch       Fallback
 continues      mechanism
