├── emergencyType
├── victimCount
├── pickupLocation
│     ├── latitude
│     └── longitude
├── createdAt
└── priority
Example:
Request ID: UK-0001
Emergency: Cardiac
Victims: 1
Location: (13.xxxxxx, 80.xxxxxx)
Priority: HIGH
The engine also receives/accesses the current ambulance state.
