5. Ambulance Information
Each ambulance maintains information such as:
Ambulance
│
├── ambulanceId
├── currentLocation
├── availabilityStatus
├── currentRequest
├── driverId
└── capabilities
Example:
AMB-01
Location: Node 15
Status: AVAILABLE
Driver: DRV-01
Only appropriate ambulances should enter the candidate-selection process.
