36. Explainability
The system should not simply output:
AMB-02
It should be able to explain:
Selected AMB-02

Reason:
• Lowest estimated travel time
• Favorable traffic conditions
• Currently available
• Valid route exists
This will be particularly useful during faculty/project evaluation because you can demonstrate how the decision was made.
